<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The CIA triad provides a high-level framework for cybersecurity professionals to consider when auditing, implementing, and improving systems, tools, and programs for organizations. It is a powerful way to identify weak points and form solutions to strengthen policies and programs.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
