111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The next thing to talk about is integrity. Well, the idea here is to make sure that data has not been modified. Corruption of data is a failure to maintain data integrity. To check if our data has been modified or not, we make use of a hash function. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
