/P 286 0 R
/ActualText (Data Tampering: If the integrity of data is not ensured, information can be altered, leading to inaccurate or misleading data. This can have severe consequences in sectors like healthcare, finance, or legal, where accurate data is crucial.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
