/P 287 0 R
/ActualText (Fraud and Manipulation: Cyber attackers can exploit weak integrity controls to manipulate data for fraudulent activities, such as financial fraud, misinformation campaigns, or sabotaging systems.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
