/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/ActualText (Denial of Service \(DoS\) Attacks: Without proper availability safeguards, systems are vulnerable to DoS or DDoS attacks, where attackers overwhelm systems with traffic, making them inaccessible to legitimate users.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
